      "description": "•\tDesigned and implemented multiple mobile applications for employees. The deployed applications included e-Directory service, payroll, HR employee tools, conference room reservations and company news. \n•\tResearched, prototyped and engineered an Augmented Reality mobile solution to assist Verizon service technicians and users with their FiOS equipment installation and troubleshooting. \n•\tLed the design and development of a mobile application for parking lot, using geofencing location based services. The iOS and Android compatible application assisted employees and visitors in identifying space availability and sending notifications for favorite parking spots.\n•\tDesigned and prototyped an automated self-service check-in system for visitors’ badges and photos. The prototype allowed for the elimination of manual sign-in processes, simplification of the visitor check-in protocols and consolidation of the visitor records repository.\n•\tDeveloped Garage Work Center Storekeeper tablet application for FiOS equipment purchase orders, inventories, and reports. This application enabled the Supply Chain teams to accurately and efficiently manage Garage Work Center transactions and inventories.\n•\tAnalyzed, designed and developed Verizon’s HR and Corporate Communications Portal for approximately 180K employees.\n•\tDesigned and developed data synchronization layer to load data from various backend repositories such as LDAP, PeopleSoft and other data feed sources. Built the employee profile service to quickly and dynamically retrieve employee information.\n•\tDesigned and implemented a rule engine with a preemptive memory cache of 200+ attributes to dynamically access the HR portal.\n•\tConducted code review, performance test, and code deployment. Automated builds and continuous integration.",
